  "helpMCCompanionTitle": "MCCompanion haionekani",
  "@helpMCCompanionTitle": {
    "description": "Title for help topic when MCCompanion isn't visible on console"
  },
  "helpMCCompanionSubtitle": "Utatuzi wa matatizo ya ugunduzi wa LAN",
  "@helpMCCompanionSubtitle": {
    "description": "Short subtitle for MCCompanion does not appear tile"
  },
  "helpMCCompanionBody": "Ikiwa seva haionekani kwenye konsoli yako, jaribu hatua hizi:\r\n\r\n✅ Ukaguzi wa msingi:\r\n1. Mtandao ule ule wa WiFi - Simu/tablet yako na konsoli LAZIMA ziwe kwenye WiFi ile ile\r\n2. Anwani sahihi ya seva - Hakiki tena IP na port (chaguo-msingi: 19132)\r\n3. Utangazaji uko hai - Hakikisha MCCompanion inaonyesha hali ya \"Inatangaza\"\r\n\r\n🔄 Marekebisho ya haraka:\r\n• Anzisha tena programu: simamisha utangazaji, funga MCCompanion kabisa, ifungue tena na ujaribu upya\r\n• Anzisha tena konsoli yako: wakati mwingine konsoli huhitaji kusasishwa ili kugundua michezo ya LAN\r\n• Angalia kichupo cha Friends/LAN: seva huonekana chini ya \"Friends\" au \"LAN Games\", SI kwenye orodha ya seva\r\n• Subiri sekunde 10-15 baada ya kuanza kutangaza\r\n• Zima VPN: VPN zinaweza kuzuia matangazo ya ndani\r\n\r\n⚠️ Matatizo ya kawaida:\r\n\"No route found for user\" → Hakikisha vifaa vyote viwili viko kwenye Wi‑Fi ile ile (epuka mitandao ya wageni)\r\n\"Unable to connect to MCCompanion relay server\" → Angalia intaneti yako / hali ya relay\r\n\r\n📱 Bado una matatizo? Washa hali ya utatuzi kwenye MCCompanion na uangalie kumbukumbu, au jaribu seva tofauti.",
  "@helpMCCompanionBody": {
    "description": "Detailed troubleshooting text for MCCompanion not appearing"
  },
  "helpMultiplayerFailedTitle": "Muunganisho wa Multiplayer Umeshindikana",
  "@helpMultiplayerFailedTitle": {
    "description": "Title for help topic when multiplayer connection fails"
  },
  "helpMultiplayerFailedSubtitle": "Maelezo kwa nini hili si kosa la MCCompanion",
  "@helpMultiplayerFailedSubtitle": {
    "description": "Short subtitle for multiplayer failed tile"
  },
  "helpMultiplayerFailedBody": "⚠️ Hili si tatizo la MCCompanion!\r\n\r\nMCCompanion ilikuelekeza kwa mafanikio kwenye seva iliyoombwa. Ujumbe wa \"Multiplayer Connection Failed\" unaonyesha kuwa seva lengwa haipatikani kwa sasa. Sababu zinazowezekana:\r\n\r\n• Seva lengwa ya Minecraft iko nje ya mtandao au imeelemewa\r\n• Seva inahitaji toleo la mteja lililosasishwa au toleo maalum\r\n• Matatizo ya mtandao kati ya relay na seva lengwa\r\n\r\nJaribu kuunganika kwenye seva tofauti au wasiliana na msaada wa seva husika. Tatizo likiendelea kwenye seva nyingi, washa hali ya utatuzi kwenye MCCompanion na uangalie kumbukumbu.",
  "@helpMultiplayerFailedBody": {
    "description": "Explanation shown when multiplayer connection failed appears"
  },
  "helpNintendoDnsTitle": "DNS ya Nintendo haifanyi kazi",
  "@helpNintendoDnsTitle": {
    "description": "Title for Nintendo DNS troubleshooting"
  },
  "helpNintendoDnsSubtitle": "Matatizo ya kawaida ya DNS / relay",
  "@helpNintendoDnsSubtitle": {
    "description": "Short subtitle for Nintendo DNS troubleshooting tile"
  },
  "helpNintendoDnsBody": "Ikiwa hali ya DNS ya Nintendo haifanyi kazi, angalia yafuatayo:\r\n\r\n1. Thibitisha kuwa umetuma usanidi wa DNS kutoka kwenye programu (Send DNS Config).\r\n2. Thibitisha kuwa umetumia relay IP kama DNS Kuu kwenye Switch.\r\n3. Hakikisha seva ya relay iliyochaguliwa (EU/US) iko mtandaoni na haijaelemewa.\r\n4. Baadhi ya mitandao (kwa mfano captive portals) huzuia DNS maalum, jaribu kwenye mtandao tofauti.\r\n\r\nTatizo likiendelea, washa hali ya utatuzi na uangalie kumbukumbu au ujaribu mbadala wa hali ya Marafiki.",
  "@helpNintendoDnsBody": {
    "description": "Detailed placeholder for Nintendo DNS troubleshooting"
  },
  "helpFriendsModeTitle": "Hali ya Marafiki haifanyi kazi",
  "@helpFriendsModeTitle": {
    "description": "Title for Friends mode troubleshooting"
  },
  "helpFriendsModeSubtitle": "Matatizo ya kawaida ya marafiki",
  "@helpFriendsModeSubtitle": {
    "description": "Short subtitle for Friends-mode troubleshooting tile"
  },
  "helpFriendsModeBody": "Vidokezo vya utatuzi wa hali ya Marafiki:\r\n\r\n1. Hakikisha akaunti ya rafiki ya relay imeongezwa/imekubaliwa kwenye konsoli (ikiwa inahitajika).\r\n2. Jaribu kuanzisha tena mchezo na kusasisha kichupo cha Friends/LAN baada ya kuwasha hali ya Marafiki.\r\n\r\nIkiwa seva bado haionekani kwa marafiki, washa hali ya utatuzi na uangalie kumbukumbu ili kutambua makosa.",
  "@helpFriendsModeBody": {
    "description": "Detailed placeholder for Friends mode troubleshooting"
  },
